  data: {
    LLM: "Only bet aggressively if you hold a pair that matches the retourné, as this guaranteed a Brelan Favori.\n\nPot Odds: Calculate the total chips in the pot versus your remaining Cave. If you are 'Pot Committed', folding becomes mathematically incorrect.\n\nBluffing on Suit Totals: Since a Brelan is rare, most pots are won on suit totals. If the retourné is an Ace, bluffing that you have high cards in that suit is a standard tactic.",
